// So this directory is used mainly for the storage of our comp DYN scripts
// We put them in here so that we have a guaranteed runnable script during comps
// Just in case the USB fails (DYN auto fallbacks to these scripts if USB fails)
// But in general: Put known working DYN scripts into here, and make sure that the names match
def_path Main start
end
// also DYN defaults to "Main" as the main function name, so no need to tell it what the name is